<title>RUSSIA: Russia to auction 12 trln rbls of T-bills June 25.</title>
<headline>Russia to auction 12 trln rbls of T-bills June 25.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Finance Ministry will auction eight trillion roubles of 364-day GKO discount Treasury bills (series 21077) and four trillion roubles of an additional 133-day tranche of the series 22084 T-bills on June 25, the Central Bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Full details of the auctions follow:  </p>
<p>Full details of the series 21077 bills auction:</p>
<p>    Issue volume		     8.00 bln rbls</p>
<p>    Denominations		    1.00 million</p>
<p>    Issue date			 June 25, 1997</p>
<p>    Tenor				364 days</p>
<p>    Maturity date		    June 24, 1998</p>
<p>Full details of the series 22084 bills auction:</p>
<p>    Issue date			 4.00 trln rbls</p>
<p>    Denominations		    1.00 million</p>
<p>    Issue date			 June 25, 1997</p>
<p>    Tenor (remaining)		133 days</p>
<p>    Maturity date		    Nov 5, 1997</p>
<p>    Original issue date	    May 21, 1997</p>
<p>On June 25 the Finance Ministry will also repay eight trillion roubles in a maturing issue of 231-day T-bills (series 22057).</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
